      "user_id": 86436,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769174131266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can help with that. Pulling up order 774-B-912 now... I see the VeloFlow cycling shoes. Can you tell me what the issue was with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769174135533331
